<title>SWEDEN: TABLE-SANDVIK H1 BY BUSINESS AREA.</title>
<headline>TABLE-SANDVIK H1 BY BUSINESS AREA.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish speciality toolmaker Sandvik posts its results by business area for the six months ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>OPERATING PROFIT (Mln SKR)*</p>
<p>					    H1 97		H1 96</p>
<p> Sandvik Tooling			1,100		1,087</p>
<p> Sandvik Rock Tools			83		  134</p>
<p> Sandvik Hard Materials		  71		   87</p>
<p> Sandvik Steel			    504		  728</p>
<p> Sandvik Saws and Tools		 109		   84</p>
<p> Sandvik Process Systems		 20		   14</p>
<p> Seco Tools				 263		  235</p>
<p> Group activities			 -68		  -44</p>
<p> TOTAL				    2,082		2,325</p>
<p>* Same as previous profit after depreciation.</p>
<p>SALES (Mln SKR)</p>
<p> Sandvik Tooling			5,215		 4,773</p>
<p> Sandvik Rock Tools		   1,076		 1,026</p>
<p> Sandvik Hard Materials		 676		   631</p>
<p> Sandvik Steel			  5,008		 4,850</p>
<p> Sandvik Saws and Tools	     1,383		 1,257</p>
<p> Sandvik Process Systems		676		   747</p>
<p> Seco Tools			     1,428		 1,289</p>
<p> Group activities			  20		    16</p>
<p> TOTAL				   15,482		14,589</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
